    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stopping the chase\" sounds nice in theory but it doesn't change the fact that i've wasted so much time. what's the point of existing just to be a footnote? like, if you know you'll never be anything significant, why bother dragging out the rest of the years? it just feels like i'm stuck in this loop of pretending that \"just being\" is enough when it's actually just empty.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
